---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';

/**
 * Grade 11 placeholder.
 *
 * Deliberately a stub. The O-Level syllabus is 25 units and 190 periods
 * (see research/04-olevel-syllabus.md). We are not going to link to a page
 * implying coverage we do not have.
 */
---

<Base
  title="Grade 11 Mathematics"
  description="Grade 11 (O-Level) mathematics. Coming soon."
>
  <h1>Grade 11 Mathematics</h1>

  <p class="lede">
    This is the O-Level year. It is not ready yet.
  </p>

  <div class="callout">
    <p class="callout-title">Why nothing is here yet</p>
    <p>
      The O-Level syllabus is 25 units and 190 periods. Half of Paper I is not
      multiple choice, the subject is 200 marks, and students answer 10
      questions out of 12 in Paper II.
    </p>
    <p>
      We would rather publish five units that are genuinely good than link to
      twenty-five that are not. Grade 6 is the starting point.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="button-row">
    <a class="button" href="/grade/6">Start with Grade 6</a>
  </div>
</Base>
